<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-017" chapter-id="c-chenshu-017-wangmai-age-and-death" source-id="s-chenshu-017-wangmai-age-and-death-ws1544244">
  <p id="c-chenshu-017-wangmai-age-and-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangmai-age-and-death:p001:m0001" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG">勱</persName>為仁武將軍、晉陵太守。在郡甚有威惠，郡人表請立碑，頌<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangmai-age-and-death:p001:m0028" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG">勱</persName>政績，詔許之。徵為中書監，重授尚書右僕射，領右軍將軍。四年五月卒，時年六十七。贈侍中、中書監，諡曰溫。</p>
</text>
